  "query_preview": "..\n(Saturday Night through next Friday)\nIssued at 1030 AM CDT Fri Apr 17 2026\n\nTemperatures Saturday night and Sunday will drop considerably\nbehind the cold front. The coldest readings are likely to occur\nSaturday night and again Sunday night, with widespread\ntemperatures in the low to mid 40s both nights, and perhaps some \nupper 30s in the colder spots. Warmer air will filter in starting \non Tuesday as high pressure shifts to our east and allows for some\nreturn southerly flow. And temperatures will continue warming for\nthe remainder of the week. The next active weather system looks \nto bring rain and storm chances to the region beginning next \nFriday and possibly lasting through the weekend.",
